:"d0db161a-9119-4e3a-a468-36501fd4593e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@UD1FQV38V\u003e 途中まで作れてるんで、暇あれば適当なタイミングで試してみて貰えるといいかもです\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh\u003e\n\nzshプラグインとして動くかがbinフォルダの扱いとか含めちょっと確認できてないんで最悪直で読み込んでもらえたら動くかと思います。\n自分の設定は\n```path=(~/workspace/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/bin(N-/) $path)\nsource ~/workspace/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/fzf-preview.zsh\n\nbindkey ' '    fp-auto-snippet\nbindkey '^m'   fp-auto-snippet-and-accept-line\nbindkey '^x^s' fp-insert-snippet\nbindkey '^t'   fp-completion```\nな感じです","ts":"1619396686.147200","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","reply_count":39,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hGH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8749862-95b1-4a7e-9777-b7db33499fa0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"fzfがdevelだからめっちゃ新しい？","ts":"1619394106.145600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UDO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db96d869-aafe-43f2-9e0b-c37acae15881","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"主要機能は大体移植出来てて、あとやるとしたらplaceholder周りとか細かいとこやっていかないといけない感じ","ts":"1619396839.147900","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1619396851.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s+v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc17368b-2021-4dd8-bb8f-eb33373d89a1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"もしデバッグやりたかったら、こういう風に実行ファイルに渡せばfzfに渡す元コマンドとかオプションが確認できます\n```$ echo \"kill \" | bin/fzf-preview-deno --mode=completion\nsuccess\nps -ef | sed 1d\n\n--bind=\"ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down,ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up,?:toggle-preview\" --expect=\"alt-enter\" --ansi --height='80%' --multi --prompt='Kill Process\u0026gt; '\nawk '{print $2}'```","ts":"1619397000.148200","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"toaT8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62dd138d-fbc8-4a34-8f79-8aa42c3f23e9","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"すごい。とりあえず動いてそうです、既存のfzf-preview.zshのgit補完系はまだって感じです?\nPATHまわりちょっと変えたけどzshrcこんな感じです\n```export PATH=\"$(ghq root)/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/bin/:$PATH\"\nsource $(ghq root)/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/fzf-preview.zsh\n\nbindkey ' '    fp-auto-snippet\nbindkey '^m'   fp-auto-snippet-and-accept-line\nbindkey '^x^s' fp-insert-snippet\nbindkey '^t'   fp-completion```","ts":"1619410871.149200","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Khy4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"233f2a18-d1a6-49cf-8d67-e0bd6712b434","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"git addとかいくつか入れてますね\nTabじゃなくてC-tって今のところ試してますが","ts":"1619410903.149400","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bciM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a92df902-a128-4dad-a1cb-68a2dc1e535d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとcheckoutとかは動くはず","ts":"1619410915.149600","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GoPt7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54034de1-26b3-4cb5-9f97-799d22740a9b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"具体的にはここに書いてるやつですね\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/blob/11dfbbaedeeabcaffa3c6a04cfd25daf004f06ad/src/completion/source/git.ts#L17-L66\u003e","ts":"1619410961.149800","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tK2Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57e65d6a-90c4-444b-9126-d797cbd5a599","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁ、これについてはsettings.ymlに自前で補完設定書いちゃえば動かせるではあります","ts":"1619411064.150200","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z7l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"081ce8e7-db7b-4972-9d3a-0f7820a42f2b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ echo \"git checkout \" | bin/fzf-preview-deno --mode=completion\nsuccess\ngit for-each-ref refs/heads refs/remotes --color=always --format='%(color:green)[branch]%09%(color:reset)%(color:magenta)%(refname:short)%(color:reset) %(color:yellow)%(authordate:short) %(color:reset) %(color:blue)[%(authorname)]%(color:reset)%09' 2\u0026gt; /dev/null | column -t\n[[ '{1}' == '[branch]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git log {2} --decorate --pretty='format:%C(yellow)%h %C(green)%cd %C(reset)%s %C(red)%d %C(cyan)[%an]' --date=iso --graph --color=always || [[ '{1}' == '[tag]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git log {2} --pretty='format:%C(yellow)%h %C(green)%cd %C(reset)%s %C(red)%d %C(cyan)[%an]' --date=iso --graph --color=always  || [[ '{1}' == '[commit]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git show --color=always {2} || [[ '{1}' == '[reflog]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git show --color=always {2}\n--bind=\"ctrl-b:reload(git for-each-ref refs/heads refs/remotes --color=always --format='%(color:green)[branch]%09%(color:reset)%(color:magenta)%(refname:short)%(color:reset) %(color:yellow)%(authordate:short) %(color:reset) %(color:blue)[%(authorname)]%(color:reset)%09' 2\u0026gt; /dev/null | column -t),ctrl-c:reload(git log --decorate --color=always --format='%C(green)[commit]  %Creset%C(magenta)%h%Creset %C(yellow)%cr %x09%Creset [%C(blue)%an%Creset] %x09%C(auto)%s %d'),ctrl-t:reload(git for-each-ref refs/tags --color=always --format='%(color:green)[tag]%09%(color:reset)%(color:magenta)%(refname:short)%(color:reset) %(color:yellow)%(authordate:short) %(color:reset) %(color:blue)[%(authorname)]%(color:reset)%09' 2\u0026gt; /dev/null | column -t),ctrl-r:reload(git reflog --decorate --color=always --format='%C(green)[reflog]  %Creset%C(magenta)%h%Creset %C(yellow)%cr %x09%Creset [%C(blue)%an%Creset] %x09%C(auto)%s %d' 2\u0026gt; /dev/null)\" --expect=\"alt-enter\" --ansi --height='80%' --header='C-b: branch, C-c: commit, C-t: tag, C-r: reflog' --preview-window='down' --prompt='Git Checkout\u0026gt; ' --no-sort\nawk '{ print $2 }'```\nとかでgit checkoutの補完コマンドが確認できます","ts":"1619411172.150400","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wfA=x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc90da43-803e-49b6-bd8c-76bdad006ff8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"見返すと思ったより異常な設定している","ts":"1619411210.150600","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1619411218.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jmwH1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2bab031-5223-4f66-b743-37519e171c14","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"```$ echo \"git add\" | /home/yoichi/ghq/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/bin/fzf-preview-deno --mode=completion\nfailure```\nお?何かがおかしい...","ts":"1619411318.150900","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AQ5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e471918-2a28-40c8-ae58-0931713b196a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、 `git add`の後ろにspaceですね","ts":"1619411337.151100","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cjw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61e8b88a-76e2-4688-a0e0-6afceb95795b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ここで実際に補完開始するときのBUFFERを渡すので\nechoの末尾にスペース入れとかないと補完の正規表現にマッチしないです","ts":"1619411386.151300","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wEUn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d420826-479a-4dd8-bec6-b8a7253ca87e","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"ありがとうございます。エラッタ出るの一瞬なので取れないんですが、C-tで補完が効いてないな...\nどこかでevalしてるのがno match foundっぽいです(C-tが他と被ってないかは見ました","ts":"1619411736.151500","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iCtG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7A846872-55D8-4886-8F3A-8326AD409942","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"echoのデバッグ結果は出ます？","ts":"1619411817.152100","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lywb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F6962501-2977-47EA-854F-D77DBEB77CA5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"補完時はechoの結果を変数に入れてevalしてるんですよね","ts":"1619411862.152800","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1619411872.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F+U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9285ad87-3946-4931-93c2-77a09e1e6368","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"デバッグはこんなのです\n```$ echo \"git add \" | /home/yoichi/ghq/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/bin/fzf-preview-deno --mode=completion\nsuccess\ngit add\ngit -c color.status=always status --short\n[[ \\$(git diff -- {-1}) ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git diff --color=always -- {-1} || [[ \\$(git diff --cached -- {-1} ) ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git diff --cached --color=always -- {-1} || bat --color=always --style=grid --theme=gruvbox-dark {-1} 2\u0026gt;/dev/null || exa --color=always --tree {-1} 2\u0026gt;/dev/null\n--bind=ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down,ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up,?:toggle-preview --expect=\"alt-enter\" --ansi --height='80%' --multi --prompt='Git Add Files\u0026gt; '```","ts":"1619411887.153100","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nOSn8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4F671473-50AA-4CBD-9186-64BA1F670522","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そこは通ってるのか・・・","ts":"1619411907.153500","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lNA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0365A791-E58B-4E6E-A979-FBE338E89C1A","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、exaあたりかも","ts":"1619411920.153900","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XZS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D473CFF3-9BAE-41AD-AF45-DF69B326C69D","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"batとかexaを適当に叩くの良くないな","ts":"1619411939.154600","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tOK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"267ba814-819f-4bcf-954d-5345ee7aa6b7","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"あー、exa入ってないあるかもです...","ts":"1619411964.154800","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43020E9C-6FBF-47E3-86F8-89DDA44D5F70","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ちょっと後でその辺確認します、ひとまず何も出さないでいい気がする","ts":"1619411996.155600","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DR3d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6be91b56-528d-440f-8266-26672d3ccf4c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"exa, bat入れたけどだめそうです...","ts":"1619412060.155800","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yLIt0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28E23283-D847-4995-B33D-E2DA69A28949","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、何だろう","ts":"1619412084.156400","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OIq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DEDC1FFB-EBA2-4237-8C48-B07B82CE7DBC","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そこまで動けば問題ない気がするんだけど\ncheckoutの方も同じです？","ts":"1619412132.157700","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0=0w8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d370c85-b62b-4fe7-b230-9134c4e61ef9","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"同じですね。一応デバッグ出力も出しときます。\n```$ echo \"git checkout \" | /home/yoichi/ghq/github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/bin/fzf-preview-deno --mode=completion\nsuccess\ngit checkout\ngit for-each-ref refs/heads refs/remotes --color=always --format='%(color:green)[branch]%09%(color:reset)%(color:magenta)%(refname:short)%(color:reset) %(color:yellow)%(authordate:short) %(color:reset) %(color:blue)[%(authorname)]%(color:reset)%09' 2\u0026gt; /dev/null | column -t\n[[ '{1}' == '[branch]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git log {2} --decorate --pretty='format:%C(yellow)%h %C(green)%cd %C(reset)%s %C(red)%d %C(cyan)[%an]' --date=iso --graph --color=always || [[ '{1}' == '[tag]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git log {2} --pretty='format:%C(yellow)%h %C(green)%cd %C(reset)%s %C(red)%d %C(cyan)[%an]' --date=iso --graph --color=always  || [[ '{1}' == '[commit]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git show --color=always {2} || [[ '{1}' == '[reflog]' ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; git show --color=always {2}\n--bind=ctrl-d:preview-half-page-down,ctrl-u:preview-half-page-up,?:toggle-preview --expect=\"alt-enter\" --ansi --height='80%' --prompt='Git Checkout\u0026gt; ' --no-sort```","ts":"1619412215.157900","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1619412221.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6gZaI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D921F745-3238-4B04-BC6F-3B1751DC80FB","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、まず再現したいな","ts":"1619412498.158500","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GpW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e77a5c4-e474-45dd-a7ee-0ec838729a1f","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"minimalなzshrc作ってみます","ts":"1619412555.158700","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/nP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7FA92C28-42CE-409C-8F24-9CEDDF75ADC9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、どっちかっていうと上のコマンドをfzfに渡してどこでエラー吐くか見て貰った方がいいかも","ts":"1619412661.159700","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=fkfJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3A1B22AE-415B-4A54-9993-16A98C1E5AD8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、理解した","ts":"1619412682.160000","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wD0lG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B679871-8D83-4ACB-A94A-2759B9DB6211","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"2行目の出力バグってますね","ts":"1619412692.160500","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LKW1j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9B9CF5C3-BA23-4D7F-83AE-4A776B0EC666","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"バグってるっていうか、自分が仕様変更したはずなんだけど古いフォーマットで出てそう\n2行目自体不要にしたんですよね","ts":"1619412728.161700","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YAU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AA224884-2F72-4A28-8E42-30BE758A25A0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今ちょっと外に出たんで、帰ったらmainのコード確認します","ts":"1619412755.162500","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1619412762.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dnf2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A77FE637-26B6-4C2B-B3CC-76F25CC7B45A","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"もしくは一旦git pullかなぁ","ts":"1619412776.163200","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D5=7+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84e73c97-4aa8-4254-ae39-0d65023eacf2","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"一旦git pullしたら動きました(あってるかどうかはわからない","ts":"1619412826.163400","thread_ts":"1619396686.147200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zi1+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DF9F5447-90B8-43BD-87DF-AE553B4F0314","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/blob/11dfbbaedeeabcaffa3c6a04cfd25daf004f06ad/src/app.ts#L83|https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview-deno.zsh/blob/11dfbbaedeeabcaffa3c6a04cfd25daf004f06ad/src/app.ts#L83\u003e\